# ssrf.deny — hosts the swap proxy must never egress to, even if listed
# in ssrf.allow. Finding 47: the jail must not impersonate the owner by
# reaching the host's own tailnet addresses.
#
# The tailnet DNS name is not secret and is committed here. The host's
# numeric tailnet IPs are filled in by proxy/deploy.sh from
# `tailscale ip` at deploy time (they are box-specific).
spark-vm.axolotl-sirius.ts.net
# --- deploy.sh appends the host's tailscale IPs below ---
